<body>

    <header>
        <h1>How to Register for an Examination</h1>
        <p>A simple guide for first-time applicants</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#introduction">Introduction</a>
        <a href="#steps">Registration Steps</a>
        <a href="#tips">Important Tips</a>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <section id="introduction">
            <h2>Introduction</h2>
            <p>
                Registering for an examination is an important process for
                students who want to take an official test. This guide
                explains the steps to follow to complete registration
                successfully.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section id="steps">
            <h2>Steps to Register</h2>

            <div class="step">
                <h3>Step 1: Check the Requirements</h3>
                <p>
                    Find out whether you are eligible for the examination.
                    Check the registration deadline, entry requirements,
                    and registration fee.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="step">
                <h3>Step 2: Prepare Your Documents</h3>
                <p>
                    Gather the required documents, such as an identification
                    document, passport-size photographs, and academic records,
                    if requested.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="step">
                <h3>Step 3: Complete the Registration Form</h3>
                <p>
                    Obtain the form from the official examination website
                    or an authorized registration centre. Fill in your
                    details carefully.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="step">
                <h3>Step 4: Pay the Registration Fee</h3>
                <p>
                    Pay the required fee using an approved payment method.
                    Keep your payment receipt as proof.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="step">
                <h3>Step 5: Submit Your Application</h3>
                <p>
                    Review your information and submit the completed form
                    with all required documents before the deadline.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="step">
                <h3>Step 6: Confirm Your Registration</h3>
                <p>
                    Check for a confirmation message or receipt. Keep your
                    examination slip or admission card safe if one is issued.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="tips">
            <h2>Important Tips</h2>

            <div class="important">
                <ul>
                    <li>Register before the deadline.</li>
                    <li>Provide accurate personal information.</li>
                    <li>Use official registration channels.</li>
                    <li>Keep copies of important documents.</li>
                    <li>Keep your payment receipt safe.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Conclusion</h2>
            <p>
                Examination registration becomes easier when you follow
                the correct steps. Prepare your documents early, complete
                the form carefully, and confirm that your application
                has been accepted.
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>

